[gd_resource type="Resource" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/legal_document.gd" id="1"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
text = "Privacy Policy\n\nPublisher: 林贵鸿\nContact email: linguihong000@gmail.com\nEffective date: October 25, 2026\n\nSpriteBonk (the \"App\") is a single-player game published by 林贵鸿 (\"we\", \"us\"). This policy describes what data the App handles. The short version: the App has no account system and no server operated by us, and it does not collect personal data.\n\n1. Data stored on your device only\n\nGame progress. Your progress, captures, and settings are saved in the App's local storage on your device. This data never leaves your device.\n\nWallet address (optional). If you choose to use the optional wallet view, you paste a public Solana address into the App. The App saves that address — and nothing else about your wallet — in local storage on your device so you don't have to paste it again. Choosing \"disconnect\" clears the saved address.\n\n2. Network requests\n\nThe App makes no network requests at all unless you use the optional wallet view.\n\nWhen you do, the App sends the address you provided to a public Solana RPC endpoint (api.mainnet-beta.solana.com) to read its SOL balance (JSON-RPC getBalance). A wallet address and its balance are public on-chain information. As with any HTTPS request, the RPC operator may see technical data such as your IP address; that handling is governed by the RPC operator, not by us, and we receive none of it.\n\n3. What we never handle\n\nWe never ask for, receive, or store private keys, seed phrases, or passwords. This version of the App cannot sign anything and cannot make transactions.\n\nThe App contains no analytics, advertising, or tracking SDKs and sets no cookies.\n\nBecause there are no accounts and no server, we have no user database: there is nothing for us to sell, share, or leak.\n\n4. Children\n\nThe App does not collect data from anyone, including minors.\n\n5. Deleting your data\n\nDisconnect the wallet inside the App to erase the saved address, and uninstall the App to erase all locally stored game data. Because we hold no server-side data, no separate account-deletion process applies.\n\n6. Changes and contact\n\nIf a future version changes any behavior described here (for example, adding transaction features), this policy will be updated and re-published before that version is submitted to the store. Questions: linguihong000@gmail.com"
